(168, 'Smadar Cohen', 'smadarpopo@gmail.com', 'Pleated Filter Bags', 'Dear Sir/Madam,\r\nMy name is Smadar, and I am looking for a filter housing that is compatible with the following polypropylene bag filters:\r\nPolypropylene bag filter size 4, 0.1 micron\r\nPolypropylene bag filter size 4, 0.2 micron\r\nPolypropylene bag filter size 4, 0.5 micron\r\nI kindly request information on the availability of a suitable product in your inventory and a corresponding quotation.\r\nTechnical Requirements for the Filter Housing:\r\nSize: Compatible with size 4 bag filters (4-1/8 inch diameter, 14 inch length)\r\nMaterial: Preference for polypropylene or stainless steel, with high chemical resistance\r\nInlet/Outlet: Connections compatible with industry standards (1.5\" or 2\" preferred)\r\nOperating Temperature: Up to 80°C\r\nMaximum Operating Pressure: At least 88 psi\r\nClosure Type: Preferably with an easy-to-use closure system for quick filter replacement\r\nI would appreciate receiving the following information:\r\nA complete technical specification of the product that meets my requirements.\r\nAvailability in stock and delivery times to Israel.\r\nA quotation including shipping and taxes.\r\nAdditional information on possible customizations or alternative solutions if an identical product is unavailable.\r\nI look forward to your response and to collaborating with your company.\r\nThank you for your time and assistance.\r\nBest regards,\r\nSmadar Cohen\r\nBIO BAR LTD\r\nsmadarpopo@gmail.com\r\n+972-50-4666002\r\nIsrael', 504666002, NULL, NULL, '2025-02-02 17:58:25', '2025-02-02 17:58:25'),
