(184, 'Gaurav Kumar', 'marketing7@qvccert.com', 'Melt Blown Filter Cartridges', 'I am pleased to introduce QVC Certification Services Pvt. Ltd., a leading provider of Testing & Certification services in compliance with National & International Standards. Our expertise spans Safety Testing, Management System Certification (ISO), Product Certification (CE/EAC/ATEX), and specialized Training Programs for various industries.\r\nWe offer CE Certification for the following directives:\r\n•	Low Voltage Electrical Equipment (Directive 2014/35/EU)\r\n•	Construction Products Regulation (Directive 305/2011)\r\n•	Machinery Directive (Directive 2006/42/EC)\r\n•	Pressure Equipment (Directive 2014/68/EU)\r\n•	ATEX Marking (Directive 2014/34/EU)\r\n•	Personal Protective Equipment (EU/2016/425)\r\n•	Electromagnetic Compatibility (Directive 2014/30/EU)\r\n•	RED Directive (Directive 2014/53/EU)\r\n•	Medical Devices Regulation (EU 2017/745 - Class I)\r\nIn addition, we operate NABL-accredited Testing & Calibration Laboratories and design customized Training Programs to address the unique requirements of diverse industries.\r\nWe would be delighted to collaborate with your organization and support your certification, testing, and training needs. Please feel free to reach out for any inquiries or further information.\r\nContact Information:\r\nGaurav Kumar\r\nMarketing Executive\r\nPhone: +91-8930344624\r\nEmail: marketing7@qvccert.com\r\nQVC Certification Services Pvt. Ltd.', 8930344624, NULL, NULL, '2025-02-26 14:06:15', '2025-02-26 14:06:15'),
