(189, 'Luke Askew', 'hello@ipflare.io', 'Melt Blown Filter Cartridges', 'Why don\'t you use localized prices? I came across MMP Filtration and thought you might find it interesting—local prices can really help in expanding your global reach, especially with your diverse industry coverage. I created IP Flare, an easy-to-use IP geolocation API that shows local prices and offers 3K free lookups each month. If you\'re curious or need a hand setting it up, feel free to reach out via Discord or email.\r\n\r\nVisit the site: www.ipflare.io', 7543652878, NULL, NULL, '2025-03-01 13:43:15', '2025-03-01 13:43:15'),
