(243, 'Reinhard Scholz', 'reinhard.scholz@siebtechniktema.de', 'Wound Filter Production Machine', 'Dear Sir/Ma,\r\n\r\nI hope this message finds you well.\r\n\r\nMy name is Reinhard Scholz, from SIEBTECHNIK Tema. We are currently evaluating options for an upcoming project and are interested in Wound Filter Production Machine. \r\nGiven your company’s expertise in this field, we would appreciate it if you could provide a detailed quotation at your earliest convenience.\r\nPlease include the product availability, warranty details and shipping informations in your proposal.\r\nAs we look to finalize our decision soon, your prompt response would be greatly appreciated. Should you require any further details from our end, please do not hesitate to contact me.\r\n\r\nThank you for your time and assistance. We look forward to your proposal.\r\n\r\nBest regards,\r\n\r\nReinhard Scholz\r\nImport / Export Director \r\nSIEBTECHNIK Tema', 490208581100, 'SIEBTECHNIK Tema', 'Mlheim an der Ruhr', '2025-05-30 17:25:05', '2025-05-30 17:25:05'),
