(392, 'Ahmed Baazaoui', 'faltmaschinen@rabofsky.de', 'Pleated Cartridges', 'Dear Sirs and Madams,\r\n\r\nIf your production demands maximum efficiency, high cycle rates, and uncompromising precision, our pleating machines for filter materials may be just what you need.\r\n\r\nFounded in 1896, Karl Rabofsky GmbH has been designing customized pleating systems at our Berlin site for decades – both mechanical and fully electronic – setting global standards.\r\n\r\nWhether 300+ pleats per minute, working widths up to 3,200 mm, or maximum production flexibility with minimal setup time: Our solutions are tailored to the challenges of modern filter manufacturing – from automotive and HVAC filters to medical applications.\r\n\r\nWe’d be happy to have a brief conversation to understand your current requirements – and show you how Rabofsky technology can deliver real added value.\r\n\r\nWhen would be a good time for a quick introduction?', 490307130260, 'Karl Rabofsky GmbH', 'Berlin', '2025-11-14 19:22:08', '2025-11-14 19:22:08'),
