(442, 'Abdul Khaled', 'abdul.khaled@spectronixglobal-grp.com', 'Dust Collector Filter Cages', 'I am reaching out to express my interest in exploring potential business opportunities with your company. I am impressed by your products and believe our collaboration could be mutually beneficial.\r\ncould we schedule a meeting to discuss how we can work together?\r\nKindly reply if this is the right office or redirect me thanks.', 2525710518, 'Spectronix Group', 'Elda', '2026-02-02 12:58:53', '2026-02-02 12:58:53'),
(443, 'Ashok Gosavi', 'gosaviashok4@gmail.com', 'Lagoon Melt Blown Filter Cartridges', 'Dear Sir / Madam,\r\n\r\nGreetings from Inland Atomize Metal Powder LLP.\r\n\r\nWe would like to introduce ourselves as a manufacturer and supplier of high-quality atomized metal powders for powder metallurgy and filtration applications.\r\n\r\nWe are keen to associate with your esteemed organization as a regular supplier of metal powders suitable for sintered filter production, including grades such as:\r\n\r\nStainless Steel powders (SS 304, SS 316L, SS 310, etc.)\r\n\r\nBronze powders (CuSn10,CuSn15,CuSn20 etc)\r\n\r\nNickel-based powders\r\n\r\nOur powders are produced with controlled chemistry and particle size distribution, ensuring excellent sinterability, flowability, and consistent pore structure in final components. Kindly find attached our company profile.\r\n\r\nWe would also be pleased to arrange free evaluation samples for trial, if required.\r\n\r\nWe look forward to your positive response and the opportunity to serve you.\r\n\r\nBest Regards\r\nAshok Gosavi\r\nVice President Marketing\r\nInland Atomize Metal Powder LLP\r\nSurvey No 230/2, Por Manglej Road, Karjan Vadodara, Gujarat 391243.\r\nwww.inlandatomizemetalpowder.com', 9673540333, 'Inland Atomize metal powder LLP', 'Vadodara', '2026-02-03 00:19:09', '2026-02-03 00:19:09'),
(444, 'Karan', 'dm1.intelliworkz@gmail.com', 'Dust Collector Filter Cages', 'Inquiry Testing', 9512818567, 'ck', 'Ahmedabad', '2026-02-03 11:02:21', '2026-02-03 11:02:21'),
(445, 'Iris', 'sales01@yangxin-environmental.com', 'Filter Bags', 'Dear \r\n\r\n I hope you’re doing well.\r\n\r\n I’m Iris from a China-based manufacturer specializing in industrial filtration filter bags for cement plants and heavy industries.\r\n\r\n With 30+ years of production experience, our filter bags are widely used in cement, steel, power and chemical plants, offering:\r\n\r\n Stable filtration efficiency\r\n\r\n Long service life under high temperature & harsh conditions\r\n\r\n Custom solutions based on working conditions\r\n\r\n We supply materials including polyester, PPS, PTFE, fiberglass and membrane filter bags, and are now expanding our cooperation with overseas partners.\r\n\r\n     May I know:\r\n\r\n     Are you currently sourcing filter bags, or\r\n\r\n     Planning to optimize cost or performance for your dust collection system?\r\n\r\n     I’d be happy to share technical data, samples, or reference cases if helpful.\r\n\r\n     Looking forward to hearing from you.', 8615951676269, 'YANGXIN ENVIRONMENTAL PROTECTION TECHNOLOGY', 'ANHUI CHINA', '2026-02-03 13:38:17', '2026-02-03 13:38:17'),
