(454, 'ANSAD AZIZ', 'a.aziz@aramcoprocurement.org', 'Wound Filter Cartridges', 'Dear Sir/Madam,\r\n\r\nAramco Emirates is pleased to invite your company to participate in our Supplier \r\nList Enrollment Program. Following a review of your company’s profile, we believe \r\nyour products and services correspond with our strategic objectives and would be a \r\nvaluable addition to our supplier network.\r\n\r\nThis opportunity enables your organization to provide high-quality products and services \r\nthat meet the operational requirements of our facilities. If you are interested in learning more, \r\nplease reply to this email, and we will provide the necessary documentation, including:\r\n• Expression of Interest (EOI) forms\r\n• Supplier Policy and Engagement Letter\r\n\r\nThese documents outline our operational procedures, standards, and expectations for suppliers, \r\nallowing you to make an informed decision. We look forward to the possibility of collaborating \r\nwith your organization and exploring mutually beneficial opportunities.\r\n\r\nWith highest regards,\r\n\r\nANSAD AZIZ\r\nProcurement & Logistics Supervisor\r\nAramco Trading Facility | Fujairah,\r\nUnited Arab Emirates', 588527504, 'Aramco Emirates', 'Dhabi', '2026-02-04 17:56:18', '2026-02-04 17:56:18'),
