(544, 'Benjamin xavier', 'benjamin@nordmanntrading.com', 'Zero Foaming Polypropylene Yarn', 'Dear sir,\r\n\r\nI hope this message finds you well. My name is Benjamin xavier, Chief Procurement Manager at nordmann trading,\r\nWe have customers in USA who are interested in several of your products, as referenced in the attached documents.\r\nCould you please provide your main price list and the terms for establishing an exclusive wholesale account for our region, including comprehensive sales conditions?\r\nWe would appreciate it if you could send us a quotation at your earliest convenience.\r\nThank you very much for your attention. \r\n\r\nI look forward to your prompt reply.\r\nBest regards, \r\n\r\nBenjamin xavier\r\nNordmann Trading\r\nPO BOX 7098\r\nRCHO SANTA FE CA 92067-7098\r\nbenjamin@nordmanntrading.com\r\n+1 (215) 421-5365', 2154215365, 'Nordmann Trading', 'RCHO SANTA FE CA', '2026-05-03 03:54:06', '2026-05-03 03:54:06'),
