(558, 'Gillian Koffi', 'gilliankoffi8@gmail.com', 'Resin Bonded Filter Cartridges', 'Dear Sir/Madam,\r\n\r\nI am writing to inquire about the possibility of your company handling the supply of your products to the Government of Togo through the current Tender/Bid supply project. This tender is open to all eligible foreign contractors from qualified source countries, provided that their products adhere to international standards and they are willing to participate in the tender bidding process.\r\n\r\nCould you please provide me with your brochure/products catalog and price details? Additionally, I would like to inquire if you have a sales point or representative in Togo. I am hoping for a positive response from you to discuss further details regarding the supply opportunity.\r\n\r\nPlease be informed that I am an Accredited Commissioned Agent representing the procuring authority.\r\n\r\nBest regards,\r\n\r\nGillian Koffi\r\nFosog . Com Consultant Sarl U\r\n105, behind Pharmacies Avépozo,\r\n04 BP 353, Avépozo Lomé, Togo', 22879869440, 'Fosog Com Consultant Sarl U', 'Lom', '2026-06-05 17:17:16', '2026-06-05 17:17:16'),
