(9, 'Hii I’m a wholesaler in Maharashtra', '7030502050', '2025-07-01 17:29:09', '2025-07-01 17:29:09'),
(10, 'I’m reaching out on behalf of Aqua Filter Bottle, a startup developing a multi-stage portable water filtration system. We are currently in the prototype development phase and require a small quantity of PP Spun Filters for internal testing.\r\n\r\nKindly share the following details:\r\n\r\nAvailable sizes/dimensions\r\n\r\nFiltration rating (e.g., 1μm, 5μm, 10-20μm)\r\n\r\nMinimum order quantity (MOQ) for sample or test batch (we need ~10 pieces)\r\n\r\nUnit price\r\n\r\nLead time and shipping charges\r\n\r\nCustom branding or cut-size options (if available)\r\n\r\nIf the quality and pricing align with our needs, we plan to scale up in the next production phase and develop a long-term vendor relationship.\r\n\r\n\r\nRegards,\r\nSuryansh\r\nCo-Founder – Aqua Filter Bottle', '8423326078', '2025-07-03 17:00:04', '2025-07-03 17:00:04'),
